00Z", "source_name": "sinmordaza.com", "title": "Los módulos para evacuados en Alto Verde permitirán alojar a familias de cuatro o cinco integrantes", "title_en": "Modules for evacuees in Alto Verde will accommodate families of four or five members", "url": "https://sinmordaza.com/noticia/522616-los-modulos-para-evacuados-en-alto-verde-permitiran-alojar-a-familias-de-cuatro-o-cinco-integrantes.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-21T21:30:00Z", "source_name": "unosantafe.com.ar", "title": "Arroyo Leyes monitora la crecida del río: realiza tareas de prevención y relevó a 600 familias que podrían estar en riesgo", "title_en": "Arroyo Leyes monitors river rise: carries out prevention tasks and identifies 600 families that could be at risk", "url": "https://www.unosantafe.com.ar/santa-fe/arroyo-leyes-monitora-la-crecida-del-rio-realiza-tareas-prevencion-y-relevo-600-familias-que-podrian-estar-riesgo-n10287917.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-21T23:00:00Z", "source_name": "radioamanecer.com.ar", "title": "Crecida del Paraná: quedan 200.000 cabezas de ganado en las islas santafesinas", "title_en": "Paraná River flood: 200,000 head of cattle remain on the Santa Fe islands", "url": "https://radioamanecer.com.ar/crecida-del-parana-quedan-200-000-cabezas-de-ganado-en-las-islas-santafesinas/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-22T16:00:00Z", "source_name": "unosantafe.com.ar", "title": "Arroyo Leyes monitorea la crecida del río: realiza tareas de prevención y relevó a 600 familias que podrían estar en riesgo", "title_en": "Arroyo Leyes monitors river rise: carries out prevention tasks and surveyed 600 families who could be at risk", "url": "https://www.unosantafe.com.ar/santa-fe/arroyo-leyes-monitorea-la-crecida-del-rio-realiza-tareas-prevencion-y-relevo-600-familias-que-podrian-estar-riesgo-n10287917.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-22T21:00:00Z", "source_name": "elesquiu.com", "title": "Crecida de los ríos Paraná y Uruguay", "title_en": "Flooding of the Paraná and Uruguay rivers", "url": "https://www.elesquiu.com/nacionales/2026/10/22/crecida-de-los-rios-parana-y-uruguay-600660.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-23T23:00:00Z", "source_name": "unosantafe.com.ar", "title": "El Paraná sigue subiendo en Santa Fe: el INA proyecta casi cinco metros para principios de noviembre y advierte que la crecida podría prolongarse", "title_en": "The Paraná keeps rising in Santa Fe: INA projects nearly five metres by early November and warns the flood could last longer", "url": "https://www.unosantafe.com.ar/santa-fe/el-parana-sigue-subiendo-santa-fe-el-ina-proyecta-casi-cinco-metros-principios-noviembre-y-advierte-que-la-crecida-podria-prolongarse-n10288362.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-23T23:00:00Z", "source_name": "unosantafe.com.ar", "title": "Crecida del Paraná: Reconquista declaró la emergencia hídrica y el río quedó al borde del nivel de evacuación", "title_en": "Paraná flood: Reconquista declares water emergency and river is at the edge of evacuation level", "url": "https://www.unosantafe.com.ar/santa-fe/crecida-del-parana-reconquista-declaro-la-emergencia-hidrica-y-el-rio-quedo-al-borde-del-nivel-evacuacion-n10288391.html"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "El INA advirtió, a través de su subgerente de Alerta Hidrológico, que el río Paraná se encamina a una crecida significativa que podría llevar su nivel en Santa Fe capital cerca de los cinco metros a fines de octubre, tras las lluvias recientes."}, "summary_en": "The Instituto Nacional del Agua (INA) warned through its hydrological alert subdivision that the Paraná River is heading towards a significant flood, with levels in Santa Fe city possibly approaching five metres in late October, following recent rainfall. The item is a hydrological forecast/alert communication; the snippet does not describe response actions or outcomes.", "title": "The Paraná will have a significant flood and in Santa Fe it could approach five metres", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(18,'flood|NP|gorkha district','flash_flood','2026-10-16T15:42:47Z','2026-10-22T03:09:53Z','2026-10-15','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": null, "name": "PreventionWeb", "type": "international"}], "agency_types": ["international"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "NP", "name": "Nepal"}], "event_date": "2026-10-15", "event_location": null, "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-16T14:50:43Z", "hazard": "flood", "hazards": ["flash_flood", "flood"], "id": 18, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-22T03:09:53Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet discusses the need to broaden GLOF and hazard monitoring after an August flood but does not report whether warnings were issued or how they performed.", "pillars": [1, 2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-15T14:00:00Z", "source_name": "thepeninsulaqatar.com", "title": "After latest Nepal flood, survivors fear for future | The Peninsula Qatar", "title_en": "After latest Nepal flood, survivors fear for future", "url": "http://thepeninsulaqatar.com/article/15/10/2026/after-latest-nepal-flood-survivors-fear-for-future"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-16T07:30:00Z", "source_name": "surinametimes.com", "title": "After latest Nepal flood, survivors fear for future", "title_en": "After latest Nepal flood, survivors fear for future", "url": "https://www.surinametimes.com/artikel/after-latest-nepal-flood-survivors-fear-for-future"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-19T07:47:35Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "The Bhotekoshi flood disaster 2026: Lessons, challenges and the way forward", "title_en": "The Bhotekoshi flood disaster 2026: Lessons, challenges and the way forward", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/event/bhotekoshi-flood-disaster-2026-lessons-challenges-and-way-forward"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-20T14:04:34Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "After the flood: supporting recovery, reconstruction and resilience in Nepal", "title_en": "After the flood: supporting recovery, reconstruction and resilience in Nepal", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/news/after-flood-supporting-recovery-reconstruction-and-resilience-nepal"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "Following a August flood in Nepal, the article notes that existing GLOF monitoring investments should be broadened through earth observation, wider hazard monitoring, risk communication and transboundary data-sharing. It frames these gaps as a means to identify evolving risks, with no specific warning performance reported in the snippet.", "title": "After the flood: supporting recovery, reconstruction and resilience in Nepal", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
