Somalia warned, but not ready: Galkacyo floods expose the failure of disaster preparedness", "url": "https://wardheernews.com/somalia-warned-but-not-ready-galkacyo-floods-expose-the-failure-of-disaster-preparedness/"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-19T19:21:08Z", "source_name": "ReliefWeb - Updates", "title": "Anticipatory Action Implementation Plan Somalia - Floods", "title_en": "Anticipatory Action Implementation Plan Somalia - Floods", "url": "https://reliefweb.int/report/somalia/anticipatory-action-implementation-plan-somalia-floods"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-19T19:21:08Z", "source_name": "ReliefWeb - Updates", "title": "Somalia - Floods: Anticipatory Action Implementation Plan (As of September 2026)", "title_en": "Somalia - Floods: Anticipatory Action Implementation Plan (As of September 2026)", "url": "https://reliefweb.int/report/somalia/somalia-floods-anticipatory-action-implementation-plan-september-2026"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-21T13:33:08Z", "source_name": "ReliefWeb - Updates", "title": "Over 800,000 People at Risk of Displacement as Floods Threaten Somalia, IOM Warns", "title_en": "Over 800,000 People at Risk of Displacement as Floods Threaten Somalia, IOM Warns", "url": "https://reliefweb.int/report/somalia/over-800000-people-risk-displacement-floods-threaten-somalia-iom-warns"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-21T15:03:06Z", "source_name": "ReliefWeb - Updates", "title": "Más de 800.000 personas en riesgo de desplazamiento por las inundaciones que amenazan Somalia, advierte la OIM", "title_en": "More than 800,000 people at risk of displacement from floods threatening Somalia, IOM warns", "url": "https://reliefweb.int/report/somalia/mas-de-800000-personas-en-riesgo-de-desplazamiento-por-las-inundaciones-que-amenazan-somalia-advierte-la-oim"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-22T04:30:00Z", "source_name": "miragenews.com", "title": "Floods Threaten to Displace 800,000 in Somalia, IOM Warns", "title_en": "Floods Threaten to Displace 800,000 in Somalia, IOM Warns", "url": "https://www.miragenews.com/floods-threaten-to-displace-800000-in-somalia-1764673/"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-22T11:15:00Z", "source_name": "kenya-today.com", "title": "IOM warns up to 874,000 Somalis could be displaced by floods this quarter", "title_en": "IOM warns up to 874,000 Somalis could be displaced by floods this quarter", "url": "https://kenya-today.com/report-iom-warns-up-to-874000-somalis-could-be-displaced-by-floods-this-quarter-14993/"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "La OIM advirtió que cerca de 874.000 personas podrían verse obligadas a abandonar sus hogares en Somalia durante los próximos tres meses por inundaciones causadas por el desbordamiento de ríos y lluvias torrenciales, en comunidades que ya enfrentan sequía y desplazamiento reiterado."}, "summary_en": "Climate experts warn that a record El Niño event is expected to bring floods to Somalia between October and December, potentially exposing millions to further hardship and hunger. The item reports a forecast-based warning of an impending hazard, but no details on NMHS or agency warnings, dissemination channels, or preparedness actions are given.", "title": "Somalia: As El Niño floods loom, millions could face further hardship and hunger", "wmo_regions": ["I"]}');
