rectly on Monday", "url": "https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/2326231/champi-nears-par-but-will-not-affect-ph-directly-on-monday"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-20T07:01:21Z", "source_name": "Philippine Daily Inquirer", "title": "Super Typhoon Champi’s trough to bring rain to parts of Luzon, Visayas", "title_en": "Super Typhoon Champi''s trough to bring rain to parts of Luzon, Visayas", "url": "https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/2326793/super-typhoon-champis-trough-to-bring-rain-to-parts-of-luzon-visayas"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-20T23:04:08Z", "source_name": "Philippine Daily Inquirer", "title": "Coast Guard suspends sea travel in Aurora as Rosal approaches", "title_en": "Coast Guard suspends sea travel in Aurora as Rosal approaches", "url": "https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/2327340/coast-guard-suspends-sea-travel-in-aurora-as-rosal-approaches"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-20T23:22:16Z", "source_name": "Philippine Daily Inquirer", "title": "DepEd orders schools to brace for disruptions as Rosal approaches", "title_en": "DepEd orders schools to brace for disruptions as Rosal approaches", "url": "https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/2327345/deped-orders-schools-to-brace-for-disruptions-as-rosal-approaches"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-21T06:58:23Z", "source_name": "Philippine Daily Inquirer", "title": "Rosal slightly accelerates; signal No. 1 still up in 6 areas", "title_en": "Rosal slightly accelerates; signal No. 1 still up in 6 areas", "url": "https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/2327446/rosal-slightly-accelerates-signal-no-1-still-up-in-6-areas"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-22T03:10:43Z", "source_name": "watchers.news", "title": "Super Typhoon Champi becomes the strongest tropical cyclone of 2026, Signal No. 2 remains over Batanes, Philippines - The Watchers", "title_en": "Super Typhoon Champi becomes the strongest tropical cyclone of 2026, Signal No. 2 remains over Batanes, Philippines", "url": "https:/