a-roja-lluvias-dana-adam-mujer-muerta-ume-baleares-alerta-roja-lluvias-2060671.html"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Una masa de aire frío y la formación de dos danas mantendrán la inestabilidad en España, con riesgo de inundaciones. Se han emitido alertas rojas para Valencia, Alicante, Ibiza y Formentera por lluvias torrenciales."}, "summary_en": "A cold air mass and two DANAs (cut-off low systems) are expected to sustain instability in Spain, with flood risk. Red alerts have been issued for Valencia, Alicante, Ibiza and Formentera due to torrential rain.", "title": "The DANA Adam puts Valencia, Alicante, Ibiza and Formentera on red alert for torrential rain", "wmo_regions": ["VI"]}');
