a-ibiza-formentera-pese-alerta-roja.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-19T07:30:00Z", "source_name": "europapress.es", "title": "La dana Adam mantiene este lunes la alerta roja por lluvias en Valencia y Alicante antes de desplazarse a Cataluña", "title_en": "Storm Adam keeps red rain alert on Monday in Valencia and Alicante before moving to Catalonia", "url": "https://www.europapress.es/sociedad/noticia-tiempo-hoy-espana-19-octubre-2026-20261019082518.html"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-19T11:15:00Z", "source_name": "aol.co.uk", "title": "Two killed and thousands evacuated after Storm Adam batters Spanish coast with heavy rain", "title_en": "Two killed and thousands evacuated after Storm Adam batters Spanish coast with heavy rain", "url": "https://www.aol.co.uk/articles/two-killed-thousands-evacuated-storm-104921000.html"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-20T06:15:00Z", "source_name": "noticiasrcn.com", "title": "Al menos tres muertos por inundaciones en varias regiones del sur de España", "title_en": "At least three dead in floods in several regions of southern Spain", "url": "https://www.noticiasrcn.com/internacional/al-menos-tres-muertos-por-inundaciones-en-varias-regiones-del-sur-de-espana-1073293"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-20T15:30:00Z", "source_name": "walesonline.co.uk", "title": "Spanish resorts hit with red alert weather warning as Storm Adam batters coast ahead of half term getaway", "title_en": "Spanish resorts hit with red alert weather warning as Storm Adam batters coast ahead of half term getaway", "url": "https://www.walesonline.co.uk/whats-on/travel/storm-adam-hits-spanish-resorts-34791598"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Entre las 22 horas del domingo y las 6.30 horas del lunes, en Mallorca se contabilizaron dos caídas de árboles y una intervención preventiva, con pocos incidentes en las islas pese a la alerta roja vigente."}, "summary_en": "Storm Adam brought heavy rain to the Spanish coast, prompting weather alerts warning of significant danger in several areas and the evacuation of thousands of people. Two deaths are reported. The snippet does not detail the warning dissemination channels or lead time.", "title": "Two killed and thousands evacuated after Storm Adam batters Spanish coast with heavy rain", "wmo_regions": ["VI"]}');
