-10-21T04:00:00Z", "source_name": "puranoticia.pnt.cl", "title": "Declaran Alerta Amarilla para seis comunas de la región Metropolitana por crecida del río Mapocho", "title_en": "Yellow Alert declared for six communes in the Metropolitan Region due to Mapocho River flood rise", "url": "https://puranoticia.pnt.cl/nacional/declaran-alerta-amarilla-para-seis-comunas-de-la-region-metropolitana-por"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-21T05:30:00Z", "source_name": "chilevision.cl", "title": "Senapred decreta alerta amarilla en 6 comunas de la Región Metropolitana por crecida del río Mapocho", "title_en": "Senapred declares yellow alert in 6 communes of the Metropolitan Region due to Mapocho River rise", "url": "https://www.chilevision.cl/noticias/nacional/senapred-decreta-alerta-amarilla-en-6-comunas-de-la-region-metropolitana-por-crecida-del-rio-mapocho/"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "La Dirección Regional del Senapred declaró Alerta Amarilla por crecida para las comunas de Maipú, Padre Hurtado, Talagante, Peñaflor, El Monte y Melipilla, por la crecida del río Mapocho."}, "summary_en": "Chile''s regional emergency service Senapred declared a Yellow Alert for flooding due to rising waters of the Mapocho River, covering six communes in the Metropolitan Region. The alert is a formal warning issued by a national disaster agency to local authorities and the public in the affected communes. The snippet does not describe dissemination channels or follow-up outcomes.", "title": "Yellow Alert declared for six communes in the Metropolitan Region due to Mapocho River flood rise", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
