office.gov.uk/about-us/news-and-media/media-centre/weather-and-climate-news/2026/storm-boelo-named-as-strong-winds-forecast-for-northern-uk"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": null, "source_name": "UK Met Office news", "title": "Strong winds and rain continue before calmer weather arrives later this week Strong winds and heavy rain will continue to affect parts of the UK early this week, with strong winds possible in northern and western Scotland on Tuesday, before high pressure brings calmer conditions for many from midweek. Read more", "title_en": "Strong winds and rain continue before calmer weather arrives later this week", "url": "https://www.metoffice.gov.uk/about-us/news-and-media/media-centre/weather-and-climate-news/2026/strong-winds-and-rain-continue-before-calmer-weather-arrives-later-this-week"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-20T09:42:56Z", "source_name": "BBC News Science & Environment", "title": "Storm Austen to bring severe gales to UK as weather warning issued", "title_en": "Storm Austen to bring severe gales to UK as weather warning issued", "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/weather/articles/c9rkyjzgp6kdo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-21T12:00:00Z", "source_name": "bournemouthecho.co.uk", "title": "Weather warning as Storm Austen to bring 50mph winds", "title_en": "Weather warning as Storm Austen to bring 50mph winds", "url": "https://www.bournemouthecho.co.uk/news/26656286.weather-warning-storm-austen-bring-50mph-winds/"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-21T14:30:00Z", "source_name": "readingchronicle.co.uk", "title": "Storm Austen - Reading set for wet weather as warning issued", "title_en": "Storm Austen - Reading set for wet weather as warning issued", "url": "https://www.readingchronicle.co.uk/news/26656655.storm-austen---reading-set-wet-weather-warning-issued/"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-22T04:30:00Z", "source_name": "burnham-on-sea.com", "title": "Weathe