en Veracruz, Tabasco y Oaxaca: Situación y previsiones de lluvia", "title_en": "Cold front 2 leaves 10 dead, evacuations and damage in Veracruz, Tabasco and Oaxaca: situation and rainfall forecasts", "url": "https://www.elimparcial.com/mexico/2026/10/20/frente-frio-2-deja-10-muertos-evacuaciones-y-danos-en-veracruz-tabasco-y-oaxaca-situacion-y-previsiones-de-lluvia/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-20T15:30:00Z", "source_name": "entrelineas.com.mx", "title": "Cierran puertos y suspenden clases por frente frío en Veracruz - Entre Líneas", "title_en": "Ports closed and classes suspended due to cold front in Veracruz", "url": "https://entrelineas.com.mx/cierran-puertos-y-suspenden-clases-por-frente-frio-en-veracruz/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-20T21:00:00Z", "source_name": "sdpnoticias.com", "title": "Veracruz mantiene alerta por lluvias; despliegan más de 700 elementos", "title_en": "Veracruz maintains rain alert; more than 700 personnel deployed", "url": "https://www.sdpnoticias.com/estados/veracruz/veracruz-mantiene-alerta-por-lluvias-despliegan-mas-de-700-elementos/"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-25T04:16:04Z", "source_name": "liberal.com.mx", "title": "Veracruz despliega operativo Estatal y Federal para atender la emergencia por las lluvias", "title_en": "Veracruz deploys state and federal operation to address rain emergency", "url": "https://liberal.com.mx/veracruz-despliega-operativo-estatal-y-federal-para-atender-la-emergencia-por-las-lluvias/"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "El gobierno de Veracruz, con apoyo federal, mantiene acciones de auxilio, evacuación preventiva y recuperación por lluvias asociadas al Frente Frío número 2. Las alertas preventivas se difundieron mediante sirenas y perifoneo, seguidas de rescates y habilitación de refugios temporales."}, "summary_en": "Veracruz state and federal authorities are conducting relief, preventive evacuation and recovery operations linked to rains from Cold Front No. 2. Preventive alerts were disseminated via sirens and loudspeakers, followed by rescues and the opening of temporary shelters.", "title": "Veracruz deploys state and federal operation to address rain emergency", "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(93,'','flood','2026-10-21T03:25:50Z','2026-10-21T03:21:51Z','2026-10-20','{"actions": [], "agencies": [], "agency_types": [], "channels": ["cell_broadcast"], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "ES", "name": "Spain"}], "event_date": "2026-10-20", "event_location": null, "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-21T03:21:51Z", "hazard": "flood", "hazards": ["flood"], "id": 93, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["es"], "last_updated": "2026-10-21T03:21:51Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "mixed", "outcome_justification": "The snippet contrasts management of the 2024 DANA floods with a more recent flood, highlighting mass alerts and prevention as lifesaving but noting pending issues, without specific outcome details.", "pillars": [3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-20T08:43:15Z", "source_name": "El País (España)", "title": "La lección aprendida de la dana de 2024: las alertas masivas y la prevención son clave para salvar vidas", "title_en": "The lesson learned from the 2024 DANA: mass alerts and prevention are key to saving lives", "url": "https://elpais.com/espana/2026-10-20/la-leccion-aprendida-de-la-dana-de-2024-las-alertas-masivas-y-la-prevencion-son-clave-para-salvar-vidas.html"}], "summaries_original": {"es": "Un artículo de El País compara la gestión de alertas y prevención entre la DANA de 2024 y una inundación más reciente, señalando que las alertas masivas son clave para salvar vidas, aunque quedan asignaturas pendientes."}, "summary_en": "An El País article compares early warning and flood management between the 2024 DANA event in Spain and a more recent flood, arguing that mass alerts and prevention are key to saving lives while noting remaining shortcomings. The snippet does not give specifics on the systems or channels used.", "title": "The lesson learned from the 2024 DANA: mass alerts and prevention are key to saving lives", "wmo_regions": ["VI"]}');
