resilience", "title_en": "World: From forecasts to action: UNDRR and Switzerland convene Europe-wide dialogue on extreme heat resilience", "url": "https://reliefweb.int/report/world/forecasts-action-undrr-and-switzerland-convene-europe-wide-dialogue-extreme-heat-resilience"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "More than 60 representatives from governments, European institutions, academia, civil society, the private sector and UN agencies met in Geneva to review Europe''s summer 2026 heat and discuss extreme heat as a systemic risk requiring coordinated action. The item is relevant to early warning mainly through its focus on moving from forecasts to action on heat resilience, though the snippet provides no specific warning details.", "title": "World: From forecasts to action: UNDRR and Switzerland convene Europe-wide dialogue on extreme heat resilience", "wmo_regions": ["VI"]}');
