rt has been issued for Misiones province, Argentina, forecasting intense rainfall and a possible rise of rivers and streams. The item is a news report on the warning and does not describe impacts or follow-up actions.", "title": "Hydrometeorological alert in Misiones: intense rain and possible rise of rivers and streams expected", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
