warning being relayed by a civil protection agency to communities, though its dissemination channels and outcomes are not detailed in the snippet.", "title": "INDECI recommends preparedness measures ahead of nighttime temperature drop in Peru''s central and southern highlands", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
