ssociated preparedness advice.", "title": "INDECI recommends preparedness measures for rain in the jungle – fourteenth friaje", "wmo_regions": ["III"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(207,'multi_hazard|CF|lake chad basin','multi_hazard','2026-10-29T04:18:42Z','2026-10-29T04:10:16Z','2026-10-28','{"actions": ["Launch of a five-year project to help anticipate and manage floods and droughts and to warn at-risk communities earlier"], "agencies": [{"country": null, "name": "Global Water Partnership Central Africa", "type": "NGO"}, {"country": null, "name": "Lake Chad Basin Commission", "type": "international"}, {"country": null, "name": "World Meteorological Organization", "type": "international"}], "agency_types": ["NGO", "international"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "CF", "name": "Central African Republic"}, {"code": "CM", "name": "Cameroon"}, {"code": "NE", "name": "Niger"}, {"code": "NG", "name": "Nigeria"}, {"code": "TD", "name": "Chad"}], "event_date": "2026-10-28", "event_location": "Lake Chad Basin, Africa", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-29T04:10:16Z", "hazard": "multi_hazard", "hazards": ["multi_hazard"], "id": 207, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-29T04:10:16Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item announces a project launch; no outcomes of warnings are reported yet.", "pillars": [2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-28T00:00:00Z", "source_name": "WMO news", "title": "Lake Chad Basin project aims at earlier warnings of floods and droughts", "title_en": "Lake Chad Basin project aims at earlier warnings of floods and droughts", "url": "https://wmo.int/media/news/lake-chad-basin-project-aims-earlier-warnings-of-floods-and-droughts"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The Lake Chad Basin Commission, WMO and Global Water Partnership Central Africa launched a five-year project to help Cameroon, Niger, Nigeria, Chad and the Central African Republic anticipate floods and droughts and warn at-risk communities earlier. The hazards threaten more than 50 million people in the basin. The project targets improved forecasting and earlier warning services across the basin.", "title": "Lake Chad Basin project aims at earlier warnings of floods and droughts", "wmo_regions": ["I"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(208,'','flood','2026-10-29T04:18:43Z','2026-10-29T04:10:15Z','2026-10-28','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": null, "name": "ACAPS", "type": "international"}], "agency_types": ["international"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [{"code": "AF", "name": "Afghanistan"}], "event_date": "2026-10-28", "event_location": "Afghanistan", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-29T04:10:15Z", "hazard": "flood", "hazards": ["flood"], "id": 208, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-29T04:10:15Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes a report on community access to early flood warnings and preparedness but does not report the outcome of any specific warning.", "pillars": [1, 2, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-28T09:33:07Z", "source_name": "ReliefWeb - Updates", "title": "Afghanistan: Community perspectives on early flood warning and preparedness (ACAPS Thematic Report 28 October 2026)", "title_en": "Afghanistan: Community perspectives on early flood warning and preparedness (ACAPS Thematic Report 28 October 2026)", "url": "https://reliefweb.int/report/afghanistan/afghanistan-community-perspectives-early-flood-warning-and-preparedness-acaps-thematic-report-28-october-2026"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "An ACAPS thematic report examines how people in four flood-prone provinces of Afghanistan access early flood warnings, their capacity to act on them, and their level of preparedness. It draws on community lived experiences to identify gaps and needs ahead of the 2026–2027 winter and spring flood season. The report aims to inform inclusive, protection-sensitive flood risk mitigation and early recovery operations.", "title": "Afghanistan: Community perspectives on early flood warning and preparedness (ACAPS Thematic Report 28 October 2026)", "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(209,'','multi_hazard','2026-10-29T04:18:44Z','2026-10-29T04:10:15Z','2026-10-28','{"actions": [], "agencies": [{"country": null, "name": "UN Office for Disaster Risk Reduction (UNDRR)", "type": "international"}], "agency_types": ["international"], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.6, "countries": [], "event_date": "2026-10-28", "event_location": null, "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-29T04:10:15Z", "hazard": "multi_hazard", "hazards": ["multi_hazard"], "id": 209, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-29T04:10:15Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The item describes UNDRR participation in a conference on early warning and risk-informed water management but reports no specific warning event or outcome.", "pillars": [1, 2, 3], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-28T11:33:06Z", "source_name": "ReliefWeb - Updates", "title": "World: UNDRR advances climate resilience, early warning systems, and risk-informed water management at Cairo Water Week 2026", "title_en": "World: UNDRR advances climate resilience, early warning systems, and risk-informed water management at Cairo Water Week 2026", "url": "https://reliefweb.int/report/world/undrr-advances-climate-resilience-early-warning-systems-and-risk-informed-water-management-cairo-water-week-2026"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "UNDRR contributed expertise on disaster risk knowledge, early warning systems and risk-informed governance at Cairo Water Week 2026. The engagement emphasised linking climate and water information with preparedness decisions. No specific hazard event or warning outcome is reported.", "title": "World: UNDRR advances climate resilience, early warning systems, and risk-informed water management at Cairo Water Week 2026", "wmo_regions": []}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(210,'','multi_hazard','2026-10-29T04:18:45Z','2026-10-29T04:10:16Z','2026-10-28','{"actions": ["Young adults prepare for and take action on upcoming severe weather warnings"], "agencies": [], "agency_types": [], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [], "event_date": "2026-10-28", "event_location": null, "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-29T04:10:16Z", "hazard": "multi_hazard", "hazards": ["multi_hazard"], "id": 210, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-29T04:10:16Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet reports that younger adults are more likely to act on warnings, but gives no outcome data on lives saved or losses reduced.", "pillars": [3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-28T13:54:23Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "Young people most likely to act on weather warnings after record summer", "title_en": "Young people most likely to act on weather warnings after record summer", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/news/young-people-most-likely-act-weather-warnings-after-record-summer"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "A PreventionWeb article reports that young adults are more likely than any other generation to take action and prepare for upcoming severe weather, following a record summer. The finding relates to how people respond to weather warnings, which bears on the warning dissemination and preparedness pillars of Early Warnings for All. The snippet does not specify the survey, countries or hazard events involved.", "title": "Young people most likely to act on weather warnings after record summer", "wmo_regions": []}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(211,'','tsunami','2026-10-29T04:18:47Z','2026-10-29T04:10:16Z','2026-10-28','{"actions": [], "agencies": [], "agency_types": [], "channels": [], "confidence": 0.85, "countries": [], "event_date": "2026-10-28", "event_location": null, "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-29T04:10:16Z", "hazard": "tsunami", "hazards": ["tsunami"], "id": 211, "impacts": {}, "languages": ["en"], "last_updated": "2026-10-29T04:10:16Z", "lead_time": null, "outcome": "not_reported", "outcome_justification": "The snippet describes tsunami readiness examples and the role of warnings and immediate public action, but does not report a specific warning outcome.", "pillars": [1, 3, 4], "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-28T14:09:48Z", "source_name": "PreventionWeb", "title": "Nine examples of tsunami readiness – turning warnings into life-saving action", "title_en": "Nine examples of tsunami readiness – turning warnings into life-saving action", "url": "https://www.preventionweb.net/news/nine-examples-tsunami-readiness-turning-warnings-life-saving-action"}], "summaries_original": {}, "summary_en": "The article presents nine examples of tsunami readiness, focusing on how communities and warning systems turn alerts into life-saving action. It notes that tsunamis can reach coasts within minutes of an earthquake, sometimes before any official alert, so pre-existing knowledge and immediate responses are critical. The emphasis is on linking warnings to preparedness and response.", "title": "Nine examples of tsunami readiness – turning warnings into life-saving action", "wmo_regions": []}');
